'''PFC Litex Lovech II''' ({{langx|bg|ПФК Литекс Ловеч 2}}) or '''Litex Lovech 2''' was a [[Bulgaria]]n football team based in [[Lovech]]. Founded in 2015, it was the [[reserve team]] of [[PFC Litex Lovech]], and completed one season in [[Bulgarian B Professional Football Group|B Group]], the second level of Bulgarian football."}}
